  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Initial Prompt Structure**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the initial prompt\'s metadata. I\'ve parsed the explicit directives regarding how to gather additional user context. The crucial point: the system *must* use the \"ask_question\" tool before proceeding, a key constraint to consider when formulating my approach.\n\n\n**Refining Clarification Questions**\n\nI\'m now determining the most effective clarifying questions for gathering user preferences. The requirement is to engage the \"ask_question\" tool *before* outlining a plan. The goal is 2-3 targeted questions to better define the user\'s needs. I\'m focusing on eliciting feedback and ensuring the plan adheres to a structured, two-turn flow.\n\n\n**Formulating Key Questions**\n\nI\'ve crafted three specific questions to gather essential design and seed data preferences for the \"Career Compass\" tool. The questions are designed for clarity and adhere to the \"ask_question\" tool\'s plain text requirement. The options I provide offer clear choices, addressing visual themes, demo profile options, and demo login credential presentation.\n\n\n"
