  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Creating Implementation Plan**\n\nI\'m now generating the implementation plan artifact and writing it to `/.aist/implementation_plan.md`. I\'ve confirmed the artifact directory path from the prompt.\n\n\n**Verifying Implementation Structure**\n\nI\'m now verifying the structure of `implementation_plan.md` to ensure it adheres to the specifications. I need to make sure the document includes sections for User Review & Critical Decisions, Overview & Core Concept, and User Experience & Visual Design, as well as the important note section. I am preparing the artifact metadata with the flags `RequestFeedback: true` and `UserFacing: true`, including a summary. I will only provide a brief chat message indicating the plan is ready.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_13461371878214632463"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true, \"Summary\":\"Implementation plan for Career Compass Phase 1 (Foundation, Authentication, Role-based Route Guard, and Student Profile) with warm academic visual styling and clean data abstractions.\", \"UserFacing\":true}, \"CodeContent\":\"# Career Compass \342\200\224 AI-Powered Career Guidance & Resume Platform\\n\\nCareer Compass is a focused career guidance and resume platform tailored for college students (BCA level). It consolidates career recommendations, ATS resume creation, mock interviews, skill tracking, and application management into a unified workspace.\\n\\n### User Review & Critical Decisions\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> Based on your selections, we have aligned on the following core decisions for Phase 1:\\n> - **Visual Theme**: Warm academic feel with subtle navy, sand accents, and clean card surfaces.\\n> - **Seeded Demo Profile**: Final-year BCA student targeting Full-Stack Web Development (with realistic academic records, projects, and skills).\\n> - **Demo Credentials**: One-click quick login buttons for both Student and Admin roles directly on the login view.\\n> - **Execution Scope**: In strict adherence to Rule 0 & Rule 5, this phase executes **PHASE 1 ONLY** (Foundation + Mock Auth + Profile Management + Role-based Guards), setting up clean async service contracts (`services/auth.ts`, `services/db.ts`, and initial `types/ai.ts`) so future phases plug in seamlessly.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 1. Overview & Core Concept\\n\\n- **What It Does**: Career Compass provides BCA students with an integrated hub to discover relevant tech career paths, construct ATS-friendly single-column resumes, prepare for technical & HR interviews, track certifications, and manage internship pipelines.\\n- **Target Audience / Persona**: College students (especially BCA and CS undergraduate cohorts) navigating placement seasons, off-campus drives, and technical interview preparation.\\n- **Key Value**: Replaces scattered generic tools with an end-to-end guided workflow specifically structured for tech degree curricula and placement requirements.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. User Experience & Visual Design\\n\\n- **Key User Flows for Phase 1**:\\n  1. **Landing Page**: Modern hero introducing Career Compass with key value pillars (AI Career Match, ATS Resume Builder, Mock Interview Practice, Application Tracker), quick demo credentials preview, and direct call-to-action.\\n  2. **Authentication Flow**: Clean tabbed or dedicated Login and Register forms with validation, clear error messaging, and one-click quick-fill buttons for demo student (`student@college.edu`) and admin (`admin@careercompass.io`).\\n  3. **App Shell & Navigation**: Persistent responsive sidebar layout on desktop (260px) and hamburger drawer on mobile. Contextual top header with breadcrumbs and user avatar menu.\\n  4. **Student Profile**: Comprehensive view/edit profile form with field validations covering Degree, Branch, Semester/Year, Technical Interests, Career Goal, and Bio. Updates persist immediately to local storage.\\n  5. **Role-Based Guarding**: Students cannot access `/admin`; navigating there gracefully redirects to the student dashboard with a non-intrusive alert.\\n\\n- **Visual Identity & Theme**:\\n  - *Aesthetic Direction*: Warm academic meets modern SaaS. Thoughtful, clean, and distraction-free.\\n  - *Color Palette*:\\n    - Canvas: Off-white / Warm sand-tinted canvas (`bg-stone-50` / `bg-neutral-50`)\\n    - Primary & Structure: Deep Navy (`#0f172a` and `#1e293b`), Slate borderlines (`#e2e8f0`)\\n    - Accents: Subtle Sand Warmth (`#f5f5f4`, `#e7e5e4`) and Indigo focal highlights (`#4f46e5`)\\n  - *Typography*: Clean, legible sans font pairing (`Plus Jakarta Sans` / `Outfit` display, `Public Sans` body, `tabular-nums` for data).\\n  - *Zero-Pill Discipline*: Unboxed metadata with typographic separators (`\302\267`), no garish candy pills or pseudo-code prefixes.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs\\n\\n- **Decision 1: Phase-by-Phase Discipline**:\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Build strictly Phase 1 now (App shell, routing, auth abstraction, profile editing, demo seed, role guards).\\n  - *Why*: Ensures verified stability, complete working handlers, and avoids speculative or broken half-features.\\n- **Decision 2: Clean Storage & Auth Service Abstraction**:\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Implement `services/auth.ts` and `services/db.ts` with `async/await` promise contracts backed by `localStorage` and initial default seeds.\\n  - *Why*: Allows later drop-in replacement with Express + MongoDB + JWT without rewriting UI components or state hooks.\\n- **Decision 3: Single-Module AI Contract Preparation**:\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Define `types/ai.ts` upfront matching the exact user schemas (A, B, C, D) so data models are typed and ready for Phase 2.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy\\n\\n```\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                           App Shell                           \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  (AuthContext, Router, Responsive Sidebar, Top Breadcrumbs)   \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n               \342\224\202                               \342\224\202\\n       \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\274\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220              \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\274\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n       \342\224\202 Public Routes  \342\224\202              \342\224\202 Protected View \342\224\202\\n       \342\224\202 \342\200\242 / (Landing)  \342\224\202              \342\224\202 (Role Guarded) \342\224\202\\n       \342\224\202 \342\200\242 /login       \342\224\202              \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\244\\n       \342\224\202 \342\200\242 /register    \342\224\202              \342\224\202 \342\200\242 /profile     \342\224\202\\n       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\2