              text: "- **Visual Identity & Theme**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Aesthetic Direction*: Warm academic meets modern SaaS. Thoughtful, clean, and distraction-free."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Color Palette*:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "    - Canvas: Off-white / Warm sand-tinted canvas (`bg-stone-50` / `bg-neutral-50`)"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "    - Primary & Structure: Deep Navy (`#0f172a` and `#1e293b`), Slate borderlines (`#e2e8f0`)"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "    - Accents: Subtle Sand Warmth (`#f5f5f4`, `#e7e5e4`) and Indigo focal highlights (`#4f46e5`)"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Typography*: Clean, legible sans font pairing (`Plus Jakarta Sans` / `Outfit` display, `Public Sans` body, `tabular-nums` for data)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Zero-Pill Discipline*: Unboxed metadata with typographic separators (`\302\267`), no garish candy pills or pseudo-code prefixes."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 1: Phase-by-Phase Discipline**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Build strictly Phase 1 now (App shell, routing, auth abstraction, profile editing, demo seed, role guards)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Ensures verified stability, complete working handlers, and avoids speculative or broken half-features."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 2: Clean Storage & Auth Service Abstraction**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Implement `services/auth.ts` and `services/db.ts` with `async/await` promise contracts backed by `localStorage` and initial default seeds."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Allows later drop-in replacement with Express + MongoDB + JWT without rewriting UI components or state hooks."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 3: Single-Module AI Contract Preparation**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Define `types/ai.ts` upfront matching the exact user schemas (A, B, C, D) so data models are typed and ready for Phase 2."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
