    thinking: "**Structuring Phase 1 Code**\n\nI\'m now structuring the code for Phase 1. I\'m focusing on small, readable components, keeping each under 150 lines. The key is plain, working code that avoids unnecessary cleverness. I\'m sticking precisely to the user-defined data models, specifically the User model with its `id`, `name`, `email`, `role` (\"student\"|\"admin\"), and `createdAt` properties.\n\n\n**Defining Data Structures**\n\nI\'m now defining the data structures precisely. I\'ve created the TypeScript interfaces for Profile, Resume, Skill, Certificate, Application, and RoadmapPlan, placing them in `src/types/index.ts`. Also, I\'m setting up `src/types/ai.ts` to include the AI-related schemas. Finally, I\'m planning out the database service functions in `src/services/db.ts` to interact with these models.\n\n\n**Implementing Database Operations**\n\nI\'m now implementing the database service functions in `src/services/db.ts`. I\'m working on the methods for Certificates, Applications, Resumes, and Roadmap Plans. I\'ve defined all the CRUD operations for each type of data, and am now moving to seed the database with initial user and profile data. I will include a demo student, admin, and profile.\n\n\n**Defining AuthContext and Layout**\n\nI am now focused on defining the `AuthContext` and the layout components. I\'ve outlined the `AuthContext` with functions for login, registration, logout, and user refresh. I\'m also planning the `Navbar` with responsiveness and a `Sidebar` for navigation, including links for different areas of the application, incorporating Phase 2-6 links.\n\n\n**Designing Core Components**\n\nI\'m now designing the core components, starting with a responsive layout featuring a sidebar, header, breadcrumb, and main content area. I\'m also planning the `ProtectedRoute` component to handle authentication and authorization, redirecting unauthorized users and providing a user-friendly 403 error page. Next, I am outlining the `LandingPage` with a hero section, feature cards, and quick demo credentials.\n\n\n\n"
