  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Route Guard**\n\nI\'m now building the route guard at `src/components/auth/ProtectedRoute.tsx`. My current focus is implementing its core logic. I\'ve sketched out the behavior for different states: a loading spinner when data is loading, redirection to `/login` if no user is present, and an access check based on `allowedRole` if provided. Now, I\'m working to implement the redirection while preserving location state.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
