  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Landing Page**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the components of the landing page for Phase 1. Specifically, I\'m working on `src/pages/LandingPage.tsx`. The initial draft includes a Hero section designed for college students, specifically BCA level. I will emphasize two key value propositions: an AI Career Match system, and an ATS-friendly resume builder. The first stage will feature the core design for the AI Career Match, with skills and educational recommendations driving the match.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_314232172329365330"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { Link } from \'react-router-dom\';\\nimport { useAuth } from \'../context/AuthContext\';\\nimport { Navbar } from \'../components/layout/Navbar\';\\nimport {\\n  Compass,\\n  Sparkles,\\n  FileText,\\n  MessageSquareCode,\\n  CheckCircle2,\\n  ArrowRight,\\n  ShieldCheck,\\n  GraduationCap\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\nexport function LandingPage() {\\n  const { user } = useAuth();\\n\\n  const features = [\\n    {\\n      title: \'AI Career Guidance\',\\n      description: \'Discover target tech roles matched to your BCA coursework, programming skills, and career interests.\',\\n      icon: Sparkles\\n    },\\n    {\\n      title: \'ATS-Friendly Resume Builder\',\\n      description: \'Generate clean single-column PDF resumes formatted specifically for campus placement drives.\',\\n      icon: FileText\\n    },\\n    {\\n      title: \'Mock Interview Simulator\',\\n      description: \'Practice 8-question technical and HR rounds with instant scoring, feedback, and ideal answers.\',\\n      icon: MessageSquareCode\\n    },\\n    {\\n      title: \'Placement & Job Tracker\',\\n      description: \'Track campus applications, interview dates, and offer statuses with a visual pipeline board.\',\\n      icon: CheckCircle2\\n    }\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-stone-50\\\">\\n      <Navbar />\\n\\n      {/* Hero Section */}\\n      <section className=\\\"flex-1 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-20 max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center text-center\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 self-center px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 rounded-full mb-6\\\">\\n          <GraduationCap className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600\\\" />\\n          <span>Tailored for BCA & Computer Science Undergrads</span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <h1 className=\\\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-tight sm:leading-tight\\\">\\n          Navigate your tech career from campus to your first offer.\\n        </h1>\\n\\n        <p className=\\\"mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\\\">\\n          Career Compass brings career roadmap recommendations, ATS resume generation,\\n          interview coaching, and application tracking into one organized dashboard.\\n        </p>\\n\\n        {/* CTA Section */}\\n        <div className=\\\"mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3\\\">\\n          {user ? (\\n            <Link\\n              to=\\\"/dashboard\\\"\\n              className=\\\"w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-colors\\\"\\n            >\\n              <span>Go to My Dashboard</span>\\n              <ArrowRight className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </Link>\\n          ) : (\\n            <>\\n              <Link\\n                to=\\\"/register\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-colors\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span>Create Student Account</span>\\n                <ArrowRight className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n              </Link>\\n              <Link\\n                to=\\\"/login\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-stone-800 bg-white hover:bg-stone-100 border border-stone-200 rounded-lg transition-colors\\\"\\n              >\\n                Sign In with Demo\\n              </Link>\\n            </>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Quick Demo Credentials Preview */}\\n        <div className=\\\"mt-12 p-4 bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-xl max-w-lg mx-auto text-left shadow-2xs\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-800 mb-2\\\">\\n            <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600\\\" />\\n            <span>Pre-seeded Demo Accounts Ready</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs text-stone-600\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"p-2 bg-stone-50 rounded border border-stone-100\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-stone-900 block\\\">Student Demo:</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] block text-stone-700\\\">student@college.edu</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] text-stone-600\\\">pass: password123</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"p-2 bg-stone-50 rounded border border-stone-100\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-stone-900 block\\\">Admin Demo:</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] block text-stone-700\\\">admin@careercompass.io</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] text-stone-600\\\">pass: admin123</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Feature Grid */}\\n        <div className=\\\"mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-left\\\">\\n          {features.map((feat) => {\\n            const Icon = feat.icon;\\n            return (\\n              <div\\n                key={feat.title}\\n                className=\\\"p-5 bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-xl shadow-2xs hover:border-stone-300 transition-colors\\\"\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-stone-100 text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center mb-3\\\">\\n                  <Icon className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600\\\" />\\n                </div>\\n                <h3 className=\\\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1.5\\\">{feat.title}</h3>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\\\">{feat.description}</p>\\n              </div>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      {/* Footer */}\\n      <footer className=\\\"border-t border-stone-200 bg-white py-6 px-4 sm:px-6 text-center text-xs text-stone-600\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-1\\\">\\n          <Compass className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"font-bold text-slate-900\\\">Career Compass</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <p>Built for college students preparing for software & IT placements.</p>\\n      </footer>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Landing page with value features and demo account display\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/pages/LandingPage.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating LandingPage\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create pages/LandingPage.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\332\006\n\327\006\001i\024}\023r\362\355$\227\275\vp@N\376\331\t\271\3753\325\314\313\2605\237\227\251\001{\263\227\345\300\222r\325\251\325\340\203 F\307\335np\230Pm\360\300\3049j\374\215\034\002~\350\370\323\030e\000Im\200\277\355\037\023\310\213\340\302Y\234\325\263@\030@\365g\350{]bWm3\356f\220b\033\301\202HA\030\237\231I\2128.8\000\341\033A\032\225s\275\006pij\2059$\212\021yuy\261\303\314\211v\305\177s\267\345\251=T\225Rj\234\207Xm:}N\226\215\346[a\371\025U\301\215\017\265\227\352 \211\357\n|\030\246\243\237\201\037\212\241\\\370U\023\267\332*tC\307f\031\366\220\344\304\310\237\252v\253\311\362\317v\245(l\b\332\221\320\274\"\261_+!Y=_U$\n\205Wp\365\206\'\244y\352K{u\333p2\201\333+\276\006\335\333wJ\224\354\366V\370\020\200l\262\262\276,\313\2251^U\212\321\276\224\276\277\324d\256\265\353\016\032\306\002p,\n\255nn&\301\262\364\206\311\354\363\245H\312\n\257\310\322\312rzuJ\361\310\314\373\336K\372JoUep\357\305?\244)kY\343\351\003\320\373\234\264qy\206\3145\\=D\253\274\226\341Xgv\321\237^\242\317$\237\006\t\264\257\334-F\316\266c\241\fm\266\335\212\232\266\2136\250V\035\"w4*\3408\362\372\354\223/\275)X\233\337\220%:VW\345\366\032\3014\364\264\325\3056CA(\314\032\276\345\034\021q\\]\360\033\200\364\360;I\306\201.\vi\026\364\036m\001\214\t$\n\316-\275\300\356}\264\207E\"\037oo\240\322\237)\f\'\342\361\262\234I\341\324\311\255sz\277\370?\211\021\264\017\016\314&&\000\316\277\232\366\374\204\256\'7\343\375\354M\265\301\v^\304\024-/\335\377T\322)\321\033\352\351b\032u\256\342\v\363f\n\0337Q9\332\214/\203]g\233do!e0\356\r\202\347\251\\k\275Nw\v\336u\032\255`\033\367?\004\347\215T\031q\365\217\251\307\2232u\234Y\320\261<N\'ag\273#%\373\'\350\331\377\255I#\\\n\217<\211&)\260oE\271\301\214>\n\"\211a<4\205c!\a-2\324;\020\265\200\263\310\234\021\035\\\355\256\344\353[\343>\342\204a\350+\236B\250\'s\216\272[\327$\035E\302\333{\212\224\342\001\325#b\307\024\306\372\026Rv@h\r\3624\323.\254\275\315\312D\207\354\360\226 \374\273\243/n^\263\331\347