    thinking: "**Observing Environment Setup**\n\nI\'ve noted that `express`, `dotenv`, and `tsx` are pre-installed. I also see that `metadata.json` specifies `\"MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API\"`. The environment constraints clarify that `.env.example` defines variables, not secrets. I must remember to configure the environment accordingly.\n\n\n**Establishing Server Architecture**\n\nI\'m now focused on setting up the `server.ts` file. My plan is to load dotenv, initialize an Express app on port 3000, and in dev mode, integrate with Vite. I\'m aiming for `/api/health` and other endpoints, making sure I establish the foundation for AI calls in Phase 2. I\'ve confirmed that the dev server can restart using `restart_dev_server`. For now, I\'m keeping a simple focus on Phase 1.\n\n\n"
