  planner_response {
    response: "Before preparing the plan for the multi-role audit and release readiness workflow, please clarify how you would like to handle Phases 2 through 7 (which are currently placeholder modules from the Phase 1 stop point)."
    thinking: "**Analyzing Initial Conditions**\n\nI\'m focusing intently on the initial prompt and current stage of this task, zeroing in on the instructions. I\'ve re-read the first turn, specifically the requirement to build only the current phase and wait for explicit permission to move forward, which is a key constraint. I\'m making sure I don\'t deviate from that.\n\n\n**Clarifying Implementation Scope**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the detailed 4-Role Review prompt, which kicks off a comprehensive analysis. I\'ve noted that Phases 2\342\200\2237 are currently placeholder stubs, so I\'m drafting clarifying questions to precisely understand the desired implementation depth for this review. The goal is to avoid overstepping the current phase 1 focus. My current plan is to ask two targeted questions.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_14695130906140432803"
