  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Planning Mode**\n\nI\'m carefully reviewing the planning mode instructions, specifically focusing on Phase 2. The key takeaway is the \"Zero Modification Rule.\" I must avoid any code changes, package installations, or command execution during this phase, creating only the implementation plan. This is a critical constraint.\n\n\n**Defining Implementation Details**\n\nI\'ve defined the content and structure of `implementation_plan.md`, focusing on Phases 2-7\'s comprehensive implementation and a robust server-side Gemini SDK proxy. I\'ll outline the server setup, including the specific model (`gemini-3.8-flash`), response handling, and security measures. The plan details endpoint structure, runtime validation, and protections. It sets `request_feedback = true` and `user_facing = true`. I will submit for approval before any code modification.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_416906864665542406"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true, \"Summary\":\"Updated implementation plan covering Phases 2\342\200\2237 full-stack implementation, server-side Gemini AI proxy, jsPDF ATS resume export, Recharts analytics, Admin Resource CRUD, and the 4-Role Pre-Release Audit & Fix cycle.\", \"UserFacing\":true}, \"CodeContent\":\"# Career Compass \342\200\224 Complete Full-Stack Build (Phases 2\342\200\2237) & Pre-Release 4-Role Audit Plan\\n\\nThis plan covers the complete implementation of Phases 2 through 7 of **Career Compass**, backed by a secure server-side Gemini AI proxy, followed by the comprehensive 4-Role Pre-Release Audit (QA Engineer, Security Reviewer, Product Manager, Multi-User Tester), surgical fixes for all identified issues, and the final Go/No-Go Scorecard.\\n\\n### User Review & Critical Decisions\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> Based on your confirmed choices:\\n> - **Confirmed Decision 1 (Scope)**: Complete Phases 2 through 7 so all 12 core features are live, interactive, and persisted, then execute the 4-Role Review, Fix Phase, and Final Go/No-Go Scorecard against the complete codebase.\\n> - **Confirmed Decision 2 (AI Architecture)**: Route all Gemini AI requests (`services/ai.ts`) through an Express server proxy (`server.ts` -> `/api/ai/*`) using `@google/genai` (`gemini-3.8-flash`) with strict `responseSchema`, runtime response validation, input sanitization/length caps, request deduplication, and user-facing retry controls.\\n> - **Visual & UX Continuity**: Maintain the warm academic aesthetic (`#fafaf9` canvas, `#0f172a` slate-navy primary, `#4f46e5` indigo accents, `Plus Jakarta Sans` + `Public Sans` + `tabular-nums`) and strict service-layer isolation (`services/auth.ts` and `services/db.ts`).\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 1. Overview & Core Concept\\n\\n- **What It Delivers**:\\n  1. **Phase 2 \342\200\224 AI Career Recommendations (Schema A)**: Pre-fills from student Profile + Skills, calls the Gemini server proxy, renders 3\342\200\2235 career matches with estimated fit percentage, required vs. missing skill comparisons, approximate INR salary bands, growth outlooks, and a one-click *\\\"Create roadmap for this\\\"* action that jumps directly to the Roadmap generator with the role pre-selected.\\n  2. **Phase 3 \342\200\224 ATS Resume Builder + PDF + AI Review (Schema B)**: Side-by-side live editor and A4 preview supporting personal details, summary, education, experience, projects, skills, and certifications (add/edit/remove/reorder). Exports selectable, single-column ATS-compliant PDFs via `jsPDF` with automatic multi-page overflow pagination. Includes AI Resume Review with a score ring (0\342\200\223100), strengths, weaknesses, missing ATS keywords, and one-click *\\\"Apply suggestion\\\"* buttons.\\n  3. **Phase 4 \342\200\224 Skill & Certificate Tracker**: Full CRUD for technical and soft skills (proficiency levels 1\342\200\2235 with duplicate guards and delete confirmation) and certificates (issuer, date, and validated file attachment stored as Data URL with `localStorage` quota protection).\\n  4. **Phase 5 \342\200\224 Mock Interview Simulator (Schema C) & Learning Roadmap (Schema D)**:\\n     - *Mock Interview*: 8-question interactive session by role, difficulty, and round type (`technical` | `hr` | `mixed`), per-question AI evaluation (score 0\342\200\22310, feedback, improved answer), session persistence across refresh, and final average score breakdown.\\n     - *Learning Roadmap*: Multi-phase weekly learning timeline with interactive topic checkboxes, persisted completion percentage, and overwrite confirmation before regenerating.\\n  5. **Phase 6 \342\200\224 Internship/Job Application Tracker & Progress Dashboard**: Kanban board across `saved`, `applied`, `interview`, `offer`, and `rejected` statuses, synced in real time with the Student Dashboard featuring profile completion %, resume score, skill counts, roadmap progress %, and `recharts` visualizations.\\n  6. **Phase 7 \342\200\224 Admin Console & Student Career Resources**: User table with search, role checks, active/deactivated account enforcement (blocking login and active sessions for deactivated users while preventing self-deactivation of the last admin), platform usage metrics, and full Career Resources CRUD visible to students on a dedicated Resources view.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. User Experience & Visual Design\\n\\n- **Workspace Layout & Navigation**:\\n  - Desktop 260px persistent sidebar + mobile slide-over drawer with keyboard focus and `aria` attributes.\\n  - Top bar following the 3-zone contract: Brand wordmark, contextual academic breadcrumb, and user profile/logout controls.\\n  - Onboarding nudges on Dashboard and AI screens when profile or skills are incomplete.\\n- **Visual Identity & Anti-Slop Discipline**:\\n  - *Color Tokens*: Warm stone neutral canvas (`#fafaf9`), crisp white surface cards (`#ffffff`) with 1px hairline borders (`#e7e5e4`), slate-navy primary actions (`#0f172a`), and semantic status indicators paired with text labels.\\n  - *Typography*: `Plus Jakarta Sans` headings, `Public Sans` body copy, and `tabular-nums` for all scores, match percentages, counters, and tables.\\n  - *Interactive States*: Every async button disables during flight to prevent double-submission; every list provides a clear empty state with a primary CTA; every AI view provides structured error recovery with a working Retry button.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs\\n\\n- **Decision 1: Server-Side Gemini Proxy with Runtime Schema Validation**\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Express server (`server.ts`) mounting Vite middleware in development and exposing `/api/ai/*` routes powered by `@google/genai` (`gemini-3.8-flash`). Responses are validated at runtime on both server and client before rendering.\\n  - *Why*: Keeps `GEMINI_API_KEY` strictly on the server, prevents prompt injection or malformed JSON from crashing the UI, and satisfies Role 1 & Role 2 security requirements.\\n- **Decision 2: Strict Service Layer Encapsulation (`services/db.ts` & `services/auth.ts`)**\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: All user data (profiles, resumes, skills, certificates, applications, roadmaps, interview sessions, AI caches, and admin user/resource management) is accessed exclusively through async functions in `services/db.ts` and `services/auth.ts`, scoped by `userId` and guarded by role checks.\\n  - *Why*: Eliminates direct `localStorage` access in UI components (fixing an existing Phase 1 issue in `AdminPage.tsx`), prevents cross-user data bleed on shared browsers, and ensures a clean 1:1 swap to Express + MongoDB + JWT.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy\\n\\n```\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                        React Frontend (AppShell)                        \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  Dashboard \342\224\202 Profile \342\224\202 Career AI \342\224\202 Resume+PDF \342\224\202 Skills \342\224\202 Interview \342\224\202Job \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n       \342\224\202          \342\224\202          \342\224\202           \342\224\202          \342\224\202          \342\224\202\\n       \342\226\274          \342\226\274          \342\226\274           \342\226\274          \342\226\274          \342\226\274\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202   Client Service Layer (Async)     \342\224\2