            lines {
              text: "- **What It Does**: Career Compass provides BCA students with an integrated hub to discover relevant tech career paths, construct ATS-friendly single-column resumes, prepare for technical & HR interviews, track certifications, and manage internship pipelines."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
