    thinking: "**Listing Dependencies**\n\nI\'m currently compiling a list of necessary packages. I\'ve identified `jspdf` for PDF export, `recharts` for dashboard charts, and `@google/genai@latest` for Gemini API integration, specifically to ensure compatibility with `gemini-3.8-flash`. I\'m verifying the versions to meet the project\'s requirements.\n\n\n"
