  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Package.json Scripts**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `package.json` file. My goal is to modify the `\"dev\"` and `\"start\"` scripts using `replace_file_content`. Specifically, I\'m updating `\"dev\"` to `\"tsx server.ts\"` and `\"start\"` to `\"node server.ts\"`. I also need to update the `\"build\"` script to include bundling with `vite` and `esbuild`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
