  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Component State**\n\nI\'ve been looking at `ProfilePage.tsx` and noticed some unused state variables. Specifically, the `profile` state is set but never directly read. I think it\'s worth cleaning that up. I also want to add `maxLength` attributes to certain inputs. It seems like a simple improvement.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3530930386243101090"
