  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Assessing Relevant Skills**\n\nI\'ve just reviewed the `gemini-api` documentation, deeming it relevant to Phase 2. Now I will move on to evaluating the skills for planning mode. This skill assessment process should help me focus on the key requirements to move forward.\n\n\n**Evaluating Milestone One**\n\nI am now thoroughly examining Milestone 1\'s specifications. The documentation regarding UI/UX skills are indeed relevant, and I will be prioritizing front-end design elements. I will be focusing on backend, database, and auth choices for the environment. My goal is to determine the best approach for services\' DB and Auth, and document my choice concisely. The project setup is next, which includes design systems and i18n files, specifically focusing on the requirements.\n\n\n**Defining Core Functionality**\n\nI\'m now concretely defining the core functionalities, including `zod` validation schemas and session-inferred service layers for authentication and database interactions. Route guards for user roles and onboarding checks are a key part of the architecture, as is the friendly 404 page. I\'ve begun planning the landing page content for our different user groups. The register/login flow is next on my list.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_15210529477566192441"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true, \"Summary\":\"Implementation plan for Career Compass Milestone 1 (Universal Field-Neutral Foundation, i18n, Dark/Light Theme, Session-Scoped Auth & DB Services, 3-Step Onboarding Wizard, and Profile Privacy Export/Delete).\", \"UserFacing\":true}, \"CodeContent\":\"# Career Compass \342\200\224 Universal Career & Resume Platform (Milestone 1 Plan)\\n\\nCareer Compass is an inclusive, AI-powered career guidance and resume platform built for **everyone**: school students (Class 9\342\200\22312), undergraduate and postgraduate students across all disciplines, vocational/diploma learners, freshers, working professionals, career switchers, and people returning after a career break.\\n\\n### User Review & Critical Decisions\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> Based on your confirmed choices:\\n> - **Confirmed Decision 1 (Milestone Scope)**: Execute **First Action (Environment Capability Report)** + **MILESTONE 1 (Foundation)** now, verify every \\\"Done When\\\" item with concrete evidence, and stop and wait for `\\\"next\\\"` before Milestone 2.\\n> - **Confirmed Decision 2 (Universal Language & Seed Data)**: All UI text is centralized in `src/i18n/en.ts` at a clear Grade-8 reading level across diverse domains (healthcare, commerce, law, arts, design, trades, education, science, and technology). Words like *\\\"BCA\\\"*, *\\\"placement\\\"*, *\\\"semester\\\"*, and *\\\"campus\\\"* are completely excluded from the UI. The pre-seeded Demo User focuses on Full-Stack Development while showcasing field-diverse examples across the platform.\\n> - **Confirmed Decision 3 (Country & Currency)**: Default to **India (`INR`)** with a global country and currency selector (`INR`, `USD`, `EUR`, `GBP`, `AUD`, `CAD`, `SGD`).\\n> - **Confirmed Decision 4 (Session-Scoped Service Layer)**: Every function in `src/services/db.ts` derives the current user directly from the active session in `src/services/auth.ts`\342\200\224never accepting a `userId` parameter from UI components\342\200\224guaranteeing strict multi-user isolation and a 1:1 drop-in path to Express + MongoDB + JWT.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 1. Overview & Core Concept\\n\\n- **What Milestone 1 Delivers**:\\n  1. **Environment Capability Assessment (First Action)**: Clear 3-line architectural justification selecting the built-in Express server (`server.ts`) for secret-protected Gemini API calls (`process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY`) paired with session-scoped `services/auth.ts` and `services/db.ts` abstractions for zero-friction migration to MongoDB + JWT.\\n  2. **Centralized `src/i18n/en.ts` & Design System**: Light and Dark mode support (`@custom-variant dark`), high-contrast slate/indigo palette, accessible tap targets, and plain Grade-8 English copy.\\n  3. **Zod-Validated Models & Session Auth (`src/services/auth.ts`)**:\\n     - Roles: `\\\"user\\\"` and `\\\"admin\\\"`.\\n     - Registration with trimmed/lowercased email, duplicate check, privacy notice, and Web Crypto SHA-256 password hashing (`// TODO: mocked client hash \342\200\224 replace with server-side bcrypt + JWT in Express/MongoDB`).\\n     - Deactivated account lockout on both login and active session refresh.\\n  4. **3-Step Onboarding Wizard (`/onboarding`)**:\\n     - Step 1: Current Stage (`school`, `undergraduate`, `postgraduate`, `diploma/vocational`, `fresher`, `working`, `switching careers`, `returning after a break`, `self-taught`) & Country/Currency.\\n     - Step 2: Education Level, Field of Study / Industry (covering Healthcare, Commerce, Arts, Law, Trades, Education, Science, Technology, etc.), and Years of Experience.\\n     - Step 3: Interests & Career Goal. Skippable at any step with a gentle Dashboard nudge if incomplete.\\n  5. **Profile & Privacy Controls (`/profile`)**:\\n     - Validated profile editor (never asking for age, gender, religion, caste, marital status, nationality, or photo).\\n     - **\\\"Export my data (JSON)\\\"**: Downloads a complete, structured JSON archive of all user records across every module.\\n     - **\\\"Delete my account and data\\\"**: Confirmation modal that permanently purges the user\'s account and all associated records across every collection, then logs out cleanly.\\n  6. **Dashboard Shell (`/dashboard`), Admin Guard (`/admin`), and Friendly 404 (`*`)**:\\n     - Dashboard hub displaying real-time profile completion %, onboarding nudge, next best step card, and summary tiles.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. User Experience & Visual Design\\n\\n- **Key User Flows**:\\n  - `Landing (/)` \342\206\222 `Register (/register)` (with privacy note) \342\206\222 `Onboarding Wizard (/onboarding)` (3 steps, first login only) \342\206\222 `Dashboard (/dashboard)` \342\206\222 `Profile & Privacy (/profile)` (edit, export JSON, or delete account).\\n  - Returning users or Demo User (`demo@careercompass.org`) skip `/onboarding` if already onboarded and land directly on `/dashboard`.\\n  - Demo Admin (`admin@careercompass.org`) lands on `/admin` and is guarded by role checks in both UI routes and service functions.\\n- **Visual Identity & Theme**:\\n  - *Light & Dark Mode*: Toggleable in the top navigation bar, persisted to storage, using Tailwind v4 `@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));`.\\n  - *Typography*: `Plus Jakarta Sans` for headings, `Public Sans` for readable prose, and `tabular-nums` for all numeric indicators.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs\\n\\n- **Decision 1: Zero `userId` Arguments in `services/db.ts`**\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: `services/db.ts` calls `requireSessionUser()` internally from `services/auth.ts` to identify the caller.\\n  - *Why*: Eliminates Insecure Direct Object Reference (IDOR) vulnerabilities where UI code could accidentally or maliciously pass another user\'s ID.\\n- **Decision 2: Zod Schemas for Forms & AI Contracts (`src/types/ai.ts`)**\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Define all 4 universal AI schemas (Career Ideas with `best-fit`/`adjacent`/`stretch` categories, universal Resume Review, Mock Interview with `viva` option, and Roadmap with `budget` & `hoursPerWeek`) alongside `zod` validators upfront.\\n  - *Why*: Ensures Milestone 1 types and validation foundation are 100% aligned with Milestone 2 and 3 tools.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy\\n\\n```\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                    App Shell (Light/Dark + i18n/en.ts)                  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202   /  \342\224\202 /login \342\224\202 /register \342\224\202 /onboarding \342\224\202 /dashboard \342\224\202 /profile \342\224\202 /admin\342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n    \342\224\202        \342\224\202         \342\224\202           \342\224\202            \342\224\202            \342\224\202        \342\224\202\\n    \342\226\274        \342\226\274         \342\226\274           \342\226\274            \342\226\274            \342\226\274        \342\226\274\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202             Session-Inferred Service Layer (Zod Validated)              \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202 \342\200\242 services/auth.ts: register, login, logout, getSessionUser, hashPass   \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202 \342\200\242 services/db.ts:   getMyProfile, saveMyProfile, exportMyData,          \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202                     deleteMyAccountAndData (reads session user only)    \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n                                     \342\224\202\\n                                     \342\226\274\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202  Prototype Storage + Express Server Proxy (server.ts -> /api/ai/*)      \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n```\\n\", \"Description\":\"Implementation plan for Milestone 1 of the universal Career Compass application\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/b7eb6c12-686a-4b63-9565-95b5457d67e8/implementation_plan.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing Milestone 1 implementation plan\", \"toolSummary\":\"Write implementation plan for Milestone 1 universal Career Compass\"}"
