              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - **\"Delete my account and data\"**: Confirmation modal that permanently purges the user\'s account and all associated records across every collection, then logs out cleanly."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  6. **Dashboard Shell (`/dashboard`), Admin Guard (`/admin`), and Friendly 404 (`*`)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - Dashboard hub displaying real-time profile completion %, onboarding nudge, next best step card, and summary tiles."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "### 2. User Experience & Visual Design"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Workspace Layout & Navigation**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Desktop 260px persistent sidebar + mobile slide-over drawer with keyboard focus and `aria` attributes."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Top bar following the 3-zone contract: Brand wordmark, contextual academic breadcrumb, and user profile/logout controls."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Onboarding nudges on Dashboard and AI screens when profile or skills are incomplete."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Visual Identity & Anti-Slop Discipline**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Color Tokens*: Warm stone neutral canvas (`#fafaf9`), crisp white surface cards (`#ffffff`) with 1px hairline borders (`#e7e5e4`), slate-navy primary actions (`#0f172a`), and semantic status indicators paired with text labels."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Typography*: `Plus Jakarta Sans` headings, `Public Sans` body copy, and `tabular-nums` for all scores, match percentages, counters, and tables."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Interactive States*: Every async button disables during flight to prevent double-submission; every list provides a clear empty state with a primary CTA; every AI view provides structured error recovery with a working Retry button."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Key User Flows**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - `Landing (/)` \342\206\222 `Register (/register)` (with privacy note) \342\206\222 `Onboarding Wizard (/onboarding)` (3 steps, first login only) \342\206\222 `Dashboard (/dashboard)` \342\206\222 `Profile & Privacy (/profile)` (edit, export JSON, or delete account)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Returning users or Demo User (`demo@careercompass.org`) skip `/onboarding` if already onboarded and land directly on `/dashboard`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - Demo Admin (`admin@careercompass.org`) lands on `/admin` and is guarded by role checks in both UI routes and service functions."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Visual Identity & Theme**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Light & Dark Mode*: Toggleable in the top navigation bar, persisted to storage, using Tailwind v4 `@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Typography*: `Plus Jakarta Sans` for headings, `Public Sans` for readable prose, and `tabular-nums` for all numeric indicators."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "### 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 1: Server-Side Gemini Proxy with Runtime Schema Validation**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Express server (`server.ts`) mounting Vite middleware in development and exposing `/api/ai/*` routes powered by `@google/genai` (`gemini-3.8-flash`). Responses are validated at runtime on both server and client before rendering."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Keeps `GEMINI_API_KEY` strictly on the server, prevents prompt injection or malformed JSON from crashing the UI, and satisfies Role 1 & Role 2 security requirements."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 2: Strict Service Layer Encapsulation (`services/db.ts` & `services/auth.ts`)**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: All user data (profiles, resumes, skills, certificates, applications, roadmaps, interview sessions, AI caches, and admin user/resource management) is accessed exclusively through async functions in `services/db.ts` and `services/auth.ts`, scoped by `userId` and guarded by role checks."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Eliminates direct `localStorage` access in UI components (fixing an existing Phase 1 issue in `AdminPage.tsx`), prevents cross-user data bleed on shared browsers, and ensures a clean 1:1 swap to Express + MongoDB + JWT."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 1: Zero `userId` Arguments in `services/db.ts`**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: `services/db.ts` calls `requireSessionUser()` internally from `services/auth.ts` to identify the caller."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Eliminates Insecure Direct Object Reference (IDOR) vulnerabilities where UI code could accidentally or maliciously pass another user\'s ID."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Decision 2: Zod Schemas for Forms & AI Contracts (`src/types/ai.ts`)**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Chosen Approach*: Define all 4 universal AI schemas (Career Ideas with `best-fit`/`adjacent`/`stretch` categories, universal Resume Review, Mock Interview with `viva` option, and Roadmap with `budget` & `hoursPerWeek`) alongside `zod` validators upfront."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Why*: Ensures Milestone 1 types and validation foundation are 100% aligned with Milestone 2 and 3 tools."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
