  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Project Implementation**\n\nI\'m now diving into the implementation phase. My immediate focus is updating `src/components/layout/AppShell.tsx` to handle dark mode surface pairings. Subsequently, I\'ll be building out the core pages for Milestone 1, starting with `src/pages/LandingPage.tsx`, which will be a universal, field-neutral landing page with a \"Who is this for\" section and a feature overview.\n\n\n**Defining Core Pages**\n\nI\'ve scoped out the core pages for this project. They include a `LoginPage` with demo options, a `RegisterPage` with privacy notes and duplicate checks, an `OnboardingPage` with a wizard to guide users, a `ProfilePage` for user data management, and a `NotFoundPage` for 404 errors. I\'ll need to figure out appropriate redirects between these and consider edge cases.\n\n\n"
