  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**: Build \"Career Compass\", a complete, universal, AI-powered career guidance and resume builder web app for everyone (school students class 9\342\200\22312, college students of any course, graduates, job seekers, career switchers, working professionals, and people returning after a career break).\n   - **Current Milestone & Scope Boundary**:\n     - The user confirmed via `ask_question` and approved the plan (`/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/b7eb6c12-686a-4b63-9565-95b5457d67e8/implementation_plan.md`) to execute **FIRST ACTION (Section 0.7)** + **MILESTONE 1 (Foundation)** now, verify every \"Done When\" item, output the required 6-section Milestone format (Section 9), and **STOP and wait** for the user to say `\"next\"`.\n   - **Resolved Clarifications**:\n     - Milestone pacing: Build **Milestone 1 only** now and wait for `\"next\"`.\n     - Seeded Demo User persona: **Full-Stack Development** (`demo@careercompass.org` / `demo123`), while keeping the UI, suggestions, and resources field-diverse (healthcare, commerce, arts, law, skilled trades, education, science, technology) and completely free of banned words (`\"BCA\"`, `\"placement\"`, `\"semester\"`, `\"campus\"`).\n     - Default Country & Currency: **India (`INR`)** as default with a global country/currency selector (`INR`, `USD`, `GBP`, `EUR`, `CAD`, `AUD`, `SGD`).\n   - **Milestone 1 \"Done When\" Criteria**:\n     - `register -> onboard -> edit profile -> refresh and stay logged in -> export data -> delete account` all work;\n     - A normal user (`role: \"user\"`) cannot open `/admin`;\n     - A deactivated user cannot log in or continue a session;\n     - All other existing routes in the project compile cleanly with the updated session-scoped `services/db.ts` and `services/auth.ts` signatures (`tsc --noEmit` and `vite build` pass with 0 errors).\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Skills & References Inspected**:\n     - `/skills/system_skills/planning_mode/SKILL.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md` and `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/3_saas_dashboard.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/gemini_api/SKILL.md`\n   - **Packages Installed**:\n     - `react-router-dom`, `jspdf`, `recharts`, `@google/genai@latest`, `zod` (all installed in `package.json`).\n   - **Completed & Updated Files for the Universal Specification**:\n     - `/metadata.json` & `/index.html`: Updated with universal description (no banned words).\n     - `/src/index.css`: Configured `@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));` and `Plus Jakarta Sans` + `Public Sans` typography.\n     - `/src/i18n/en.ts`: Created centralized plain-English UI strings dictionary (Grade-8 level, zero banned words).\n     - `/src/types/index.ts`: Updated to exact Section 5 data models (`User` with `role: \"user\"|\"admin\"`, `active`, `onboarded`; `Profile` with `currentStatus`, `educationLevel`, `fieldOfStudy`, `experienceYears`, `interests[]`, `careerGoal`, `country`, `currency`, `bio` + `ProfileSchema`; `Resume` with `mode: \"fresher\"|\"experienced\"|\"academic\"`, `personal{name,email,phone,location,links[]}`, `optionalSections[]`, `lastScore`; `Skill` with `category: \"technical\"|\"soft\"|\"domain\"|\"language\"`; `Certificate`; `Opportunity` with 6 types and 6 statuses; `RoadmapPlan` with `progress`; `CareerResult`; `Resource`).\n     - `/src/types/ai.ts`: Updated with Zod schemas (`CareerIdeasOutputSchema`, `ResumeReviewOutputSchema`, `MockInterviewQuestionsOutputSchema`, `AnswerEvaluationOutputSchema`, `LearningRoadmapOutputSchema`) matching Section 4.\n     - `/src/services/auth.ts`: Updated with SHA-256 Web Crypto password hashing (`// TODO: mocked`), `requireSessionUser()`, `markCurrentUserOnboarded()`, `updateCurrentUserName()`, `removeCurrentUserRecord()`, `listUsers()`, `toggleUserActiveStatus()`, and seeded demo accounts (`demo@careercompass.org` / `demo123` and `admin@careercompass.org` / `admin123`).\n     - `/src/services/db.ts`: Updated so **every** function derives the current user from `requireSessionUser()` (never accepting `userId` from UI). Includes `exportMyDataAsJson()` and `deleteMyAccountAndAllData()`.\n     - `/server.ts` & `/src/services/ai.ts`: Updated with universal field-neutral Gemini 3.8 Flash endpoints, Zod validation, 1x automatic retry on invalid schema, and 2-second cooldown protection.\n     - `/src/context/AuthContext.tsx`: Updated with `darkMode`, `toggleDarkMode`, `completeOnboarding`, and cross-tab `storage` listener.\n     - `/src/components/auth/ProtectedRoute.tsx`: Updated with `/onboarding` redirect for un-onboarded `user` accounts and 403 barrier for `/admin`.\n     - `/src/components/layout/Navbar.tsx`, `/src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx`, `/src/components/layout/AppShell.tsx`: Updated with Light/Dark mode support and Section 2 routes (`/career-ideas`, `/opportunities`, etc.).\n     - `/src/pages/LandingPage.tsx`, `/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx`, `/src/pages/RegisterPage.tsx`, `/src/pages/OnboardingPage.tsx`, `/src/pages/ProfilePage.tsx`, `/src/pages/NotFoundPage.tsx`, `/src/pages/DashboardPage.tsx`, `/src/pages/AdminPage.tsx`, `/src/pages/RecommendationsPage.tsx`, `/src/pages/SkillsPage.tsx`: All updated to the new session-scoped services and universal models.\n   - **Remaining Files to Update Before Running `compile_applet` & `lint_applet`**:\n     - The following 6 files from the earlier build still reference the older `types/index.ts` and `services/db.ts` signatures (which used `userId` parameters, `personal.linkedin`/`github` instead of `personal.links[]`, `keywordsMissing` vs `atsKeywordsMissing`, `practiceIdea` vs `projectIdea`, `Application` vs `Opportunity`, and `CareerResource` vs `Resource`):\n       1. `/src/utils/pdfExport.ts`\n       2. `/src/components/resume/ResumeLivePreview.tsx`\n       3. `/src/pages/ResumePage.tsx`\n       4. `/src/pages/InterviewPage.tsx`\n       5. `/src/pages/RoadmapPage.tsx`\n       6. `/src/pages/TrackerPage.tsx` (update for `Opportunity` model) and `/src/pages/ResourcesPage.tsx` (update for `Resource` model)\n       7. `/src/App.tsx` (wire `/onboarding`, `/career-ideas`, `/opportunities`, and `<NotFoundPage />` on `*`).\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - **Strict Session-Scoped Service Rule**: Section 5 requires: *\"Every service function takes the CURRENT user from the session, never a userId from the UI, so one user can never read or change another user\'s data.\"* This is already implemented in `/src/services/db.ts` and `/src/services/auth.ts`.\n   - **Banned Words**: Section 1 prohibits `\"BCA\"`, `\"placement\"`, `\"semester\"`, and `\"campus\"` anywhere in the UI. We must verify with `grep -rnE -i \'bca|placement|semester|campus\' src index.html metadata.json` after updating the remaining 6 files.\n   - **Model & Schema Field Names**:\n     - `Resume.personal` now has `{ name, email, phone, location, links: string[] }` (no photo, no separate linkedin/github keys) and `Resume.mode: \"fresher\" | \"experienced\" | \"academic\"` plus `Resume.optionalSections: OptionalSection[]` and `Resume.lastScore?: number`.\n     - `ResumeReviewOutput` uses `keywordsMissing: string[]` (instead of `atsKeywordsMissing`).\n     - `RoadmapPhase` uses `practiceIdea: string` (instead of `projectIdea`) and `RoadmapPlan` uses `progress: string[]` (instead of `completedTopics`).\n     - `Opportunity` replaces `Application` with `title`, `organization`, `type: \"job\"|\"internship\"|\"exam\"|\"scholarship\"|\"admission\"|\"freelance\"`, `status: \"saved\"|\"applied\"|\"interview\"|\"offer\"|\"rejected\"|\"closed\"`, `deadline`, `appliedDate`, `notes`.\n     - `Resource` replaces `CareerResource` with `{ id, title, category, link, description, createdBy }`.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - No unresolved build errors yet; the final 6 component files (`pdfExport.ts`, `ResumeLivePreview.tsx`, `ResumePage.tsx`, `InterviewPage.tsx`, `RoadmapPage.tsx`, `TrackerPage.tsx`, `ResourcesPage.tsx`, `App.tsx`) simply need to be updated to match the new `types/index.ts`, `types/ai.ts`, and session-scoped `services/db.ts` signatures before running `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - Dev server (`tsx server.ts`) runs on port 3000.\n   - Artifact `/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/b7eb6c12-686a-4b63-9565-95b5457d67e8/implementation_plan.md` was approved by the user (`Proceed`).\n\n6. **Next Steps (Immediate Execution Plan)**\n   1. Update `/src/utils/pdfExport.ts`, `/src/components/resume/ResumeLivePreview.tsx`, and `/src/pages/ResumePage.tsx` to use the new `Resume` model (`mode`, `personal.links[]`, `optionalSections[]`, `lastScore`), `ResumeReviewOutput.keywordsMissing`, and session-scoped `getResume()`/`saveResume()`/`getLastResumeReview()`/`saveResumeReview()` (0 `userId` arguments) and remove any banned words.\n   2. Update `/src/pages/InterviewPage.tsx` and `/src/pages/RoadmapPage.tsx` to use the new session-scoped `services/db.ts` functions (`getInterviewSession()`, `saveInterviewSession()`, `clearInterviewSession()`, `getRoadmap()`, `saveRoadmap()`) and `RoadmapPhase.practiceIdea` / `RoadmapPlan.progress` / `generateInterviewQuestions({ role, field, difficulty, type })` / `generateRoadmap({ targetRole, currentSkills, weeksAvailable, hoursPerWeek, budget })`.\n   3. Update `/src/pages/TrackerPage.tsx` (using `listOpportunities()`, `saveOpportunity()`, `deleteOpportunity()` and the `Opportunity` model) and `/src/pages/ResourcesPage.tsx` (using `listResources()` and the `Resource` model).\n   4. Update `/src/App.tsx` to mount all required routes from Section 2: `/`, `/register`, `/login`, `/onboarding`, `/dashboard`, `/career-ideas`, `/resume`, `/skills`, `/interview`, `/roadmap`, `/opportunities`, `/resources`, `/profile`, `/admin` (`allowedRole=\"admin\"`), and `*` (`<NotFoundPage />`).\n   5. Run `grep` via `run_command` to confirm zero occurrences of banned words (`bca`, `placement`, `semester`, `campus`) in `src/`, `index.html`, and `metadata.json`.\n   6. Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` in the same turn (and `restart_dev_server` if needed) to verify 0 TypeScript or build errors.\n   7. Deliver the final response strictly following **Section 0.7 (First Action)** and **Section 9 (Output Format for Milestone 1)**:\n      - First Action: 3-line explanation of backend/database/auth/secret-storage options supported in this environment and why Express server proxy (`server.ts` for `GEMINI_API_KEY`) + session-scoped `services/db.ts` & `services/auth.ts` (`localStorage` prototype ready for Express + MongoDB + JWT) was chosen.\n      - 1) Assumptions and plan (5\342\200\2238 lines)\n      - 2) File tree of what was added or changed\n      - 3) Key code highlights\n      - 4) \"Done when\" checklist for Milestone 1 with PASS/FAIL and concrete file/function evidence\n      - 5) Known limitations or mocked parts (`TODO: mocked` client-side SHA-256 password hash and browser storage prototype)\n      - 6) What the user should test manually (5 specific steps)\n      - **STOP and wait** for the user to say `\"next\"`.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Obey all Section 0\342\200\2239 rules: no `any`, no `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`, no words `\"BCA\"`, `\"placement\"`, `\"semester\"`, `\"campus\"` in the UI, all UI strings in `i18n/en.ts`, every service function in `services/db.ts` reads the current user from the session (`requireSessionUser()`), never from UI parameters.\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` on the final build check before yielding.\n</summary>"
