      text: "<clarifying-answers>\nQ: Which visual theme and aesthetic direction do you prefer for Career Compass?\nA: Warm academic feel with subtle navy and sand accents\nQ: What background should we seed for the default demo student profile in Phase 1?\nA: Final-year BCA student targeting Full-Stack Web Development\nQ: How would you like demo credentials presented on the login page?\nA: One-click quick login buttons for Student and Admin\n</clarifying-answers>"
