  planner_response {
    response: "Yes \342\200\224 **Career Compass is live, compiled with zero errors, and ready to use right now** in the preview window.\n\nHere is what is ready and working at this moment:\n- **Milestone 1 (Foundation \342\200\224 Verified & Complete)**:\n  - **One-Click Demo Logins** on `/login`: **Demo User** (`demo@careercompass.org` / `demo123`, seeded with a Full-Stack Development profile in India `INR`) and **Demo Admin** (`admin@careercompass.org` / `admin123`).\n  - **2-Minute Onboarding Wizard** (`/onboarding`) for new accounts with stage, field, global country/currency selector (`INR`, `USD`, `GBP`, `EUR`, `CAD`, `AUD`, `SGD`), interests, and starter skills.\n  - **Profile & Privacy Controls** (`/profile`) with Zod validation, **Export My Data (JSON)**, and **Delete My Account and All Data**.\n  - **Light / Dark Mode toggle** in the top navigation bar and role/deactivation route guards (`/admin` protected for admins only).\n- **All Core Modules & AI Endpoints Mounted**:\n  - **Dashboard** (`/dashboard`), **Career Ideas** (`/career-ideas`), **Resume Builder + PDF Download + AI Review** (`/resume`), **Skills & Certificates** (`/skills`), **Mock Interview & Viva Practice** (`/interview`), **AI Learning Roadmap** (`/roadmap`), **Opportunities Tracker** (`/opportunities`), **Free Resources** (`/resources`), and **Admin Panel** (`/admin`) are all wired to the Express + Gemini AI server (`server.ts`) and session-scoped storage (`services/db.ts`).\n\nBecause you selected **\"Build Milestone 1 only now and wait for next\"**, I stopped here so you can test the foundation first. Reply **`\"next\"`** whenever you want me to proceed with the **Milestone 2 & Milestone 3** verification checklists and the **4-Role Pre-Release Audit**."
